SUMMARY:Rainbow Connection
DESCRIPTION:Rainbow Connection offers a free\, confidential space for any
 one under the LGBTQ+ umbrella to find community\, explore topics related 
 to their identities\, learn about mental health topics\, or just have a w
 eekly reset. This is a drop-in support group that does not require studen
 ts to sign up to participate.9/28 – "who I am" person drawing/talk abou
 t values and identity  10/5 – fall break intentions list/talk about sel
 f-care and goals  10/12 – mandalas/talk about mindfulness  10/19 - deco
 rate a "worth jar"/talk about gratitude and self-worth  10/26 – Winter 
 Boos/ talk about self-care  11/2 – expressive art/talk about emotion re
 gulation  11/9 – decorate tote bags  11/6 - stress balls/talk about str
 ess management  11/23 (Thanksgiving break) not meeting  11/30 – sensory
  jars/talk about stress management and mindfulness  12/7 – coping toolb
 oxAll Indiana University events\, groups\, activities\, educational\, cul
 tural\, and historical observances welcome all members of the Indiana Uni
 versity community.
