SUMMARY:LGBTQ+ Career Support
DESCRIPTION:Have personalized support to explore your goals\, build your 
 confidence\, and take the next step in your career journey. A career cons
 ultant will be available to meet with students and address unique needs.E
 xplore Your PathClarify your goals and discover career options that fit y
 ou      Make An ImpactPolish your resume\, cover letters\, and applicatio
 n materials      Build ConfidencePractice interviewing\, networking\, and
  advocating      Affirming SupportReceive personalized guidance in a safe
  and support space      And more!Finding resources\, investigating workpl
 ace culture\, legal protections\, etc.        Appointments available for 
 individuals and small groups.
