BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:IU LGBTQ+ Culture Center
DTSTART:20261112T223000Z
DTEND:20261112T233000Z
LOCATION:SIDNEY AND LOIS ESKENAZI MUSEUM OF ART
GEO:39.169144;-86.519739
SUMMARY:Queering Art History Tour
DESCRIPTION:&#160\;  Join the LGBTQ+ Culture Center at the Sidney and Loi
 s Eskenazi Museum of Art for a guided exploration of art through queer pe
 rspectives. Together\, we'll consider how gender\, sexuality\, identity\,
  relationships\, and self-expression can shape the ways we understand art
  and its histories. Whether you're an art enthusiast or simply curious\, 
 come explore\, ask questions\, and discover new ways of looking at famili
 ar and perhaps unfamiliar works. Pease make sure to RSVP to the event if 
 you are interested.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  &#160\;</p><p>  Join the LGBTQ+ Culture
  Center at the Sidney and Lois Eskenazi Museum of Art for a guided explor
 ation of art through queer perspectives. Together\, we'll consider how ge
 nder\, sexuality\, identity\, relationships\, and self-expression can sha
 pe the ways we understand art and its histories. Whether you're an art en
 thusiast or simply curious\, come explore\, ask questions\, and discover 
 new ways of looking at familiar and perhaps unfamiliar works. Pease make 
 sure to RSVP to the event if you are interested.</p>
